<div class="report-footer">
    <p>Data source: <a href="http://insideairbnb.com" target="_blank">Inside Airbnb</a> (CC BY 4.0) &bull; Scraped {R['scrape_date']} &bull; Report generated April 2026</p>
    <p>This report was generated from a 50,000-row sample. Results should be validated against the complete 292,802-listing dataset for production use.</p>
</div>

